** The hexa20 contact patch test of SurfaceToDeformableSurfaceContactPatchHexa20, integrated on the
** parent element faces and projected onto the curved master faces (issue #216):
** quadrature=parentFace (3 x 3 Gauss points on each of the 4 slave quad8 faces, weighted with the
** face's own surface Jacobian; the facets play no part in the integration) and
** masterProjection=parentFace (the flat-facet closest point refined by Newton's method on the
** master's parent face, with the surface normal there). The exact solution is the same homogeneous
** uniaxial stress, contact pressure 360 and a flat interface.
**
** Measured, at full load (36 slave points = 4 faces x 9):
**   RFNormal     359.8920323902831, the C3D8 reference's 359.89203239028274 to 13 digits.
**   Uzspread     2.7e-16: the interface is flat to machine precision.
**   gapMax       -1.1996401079e-5 == -360/3e7 == -p/penalty at every point.
**   pNspread     4.6e-11.
**   cornerForce  -29.991002698979603, against -4 * p * A / 12 = -29.99100269919026.
**
** The pressures and gaps are per Gauss point, nine per slave parent face, so their fromExpression
** outputs are tied to upper_back -- the four elements owning those faces -- rather than to the facet
** element set, whose 24 facets no longer carry the points.
*material, name=LinearElastic, id=linearelastic, provider=edelweiss
1.8e4, 0.0

*job, name=patchjob, domain=3d
*solver, solver=NIST, name=theSolver

*modelGenerator, generator=boxGen, name=lower
nX      =2
nY      =2
nZ      =1
x0      =0
y0      =0
z0      =0
lX      =1
lY      =1
lZ      =1
elProvider =edelweiss
elType  =C3D20

*modelGenerator, generator=boxGen, name=upper
nX      =2
nY      =2
nZ      =1
x0      =0
y0      =0
z0      =1.02
lX      =1
lY      =1
lZ      =1
elProvider =edelweiss
elType  =C3D20

*modelGenerator, generator=surfaceElementGenerator, name=gen1
surface = upper_back
name    = slaveSurf
triangulation = midside

*modelGenerator, generator=surfaceElementGenerator, name=gen2
surface = lower_front
name    = masterSurf
triangulation = midside

*section, name=section1, material=linearelastic, type=solid
lower_all
upper_all

*constraint, name=contact, type=surfaceToDeformableSurfacePenalty
slaveSurface=slaveSurf_facets, masterSurface=masterSurf_facets, penalty=3e7, type=linear,
searchDistance=1.0, sliding=small, quadrature=parentFace, gaussPointsPerDirection=3,
masterProjection=parentFace

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, elSet=lower_all, field=displacement, result=U, name=dispLower
>>perNode, elSet=upper_all, field=displacement, result=U, name=dispUpper
>>perNode, name=RFNormal, nSet=lower_back, field=displacement, result=P, f(x)='sum(x[:,2])', saveHistory=True
>>perNode, name=Uzspread, nSet=slaveSurf_nodes, field=displacement, result=U, f(x)='np.max(x[:,2])-np.min(x[:,2])', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=gapMax, elSet=upper_back, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getGaps()', f(x)='np.max(x)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=cornerForce, nSet=slaveSurf_nodes, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getSlaveNodalNormalForces()', f(x)='np.min(x)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=pNmean, elSet=upper_back, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getNormalPressures()', f(x)='np.mean(x[x>0]) if np.any(x>0) else np.float64(0.0)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=pNspread, elSet=upper_back, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getNormalPressures()', f(x)='(np.max(x[x>0])-np.min(x[x>0]))/np.mean(x[x>0]) if np.any(x>0) else np.float64(0.0)', saveHistory=True

*output, type=monitor, name=monitor
fieldOutput=RFNormal
fieldOutput=Uzspread
fieldOutput=gapMax
fieldOutput=cornerForce
fieldOutput=pNmean
fieldOutput=pNspread

*step, solver=theSolver
maxInc=0.25, minInc=1e-6, maxNumInc=100, maxIter=25, stepLength=1
>>options, name=theSolver, extrapolation=off
>>dirichlet, name=fixLower, nSet=lower_back, field=displacement, 1=0.0, 2=0.0, 3=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=pushUpper, nSet=upper_front, field=displacement, 1=0.0, 2=0.0, 3=-0.06
